resources.string:
✅ Added Habits with daily reminders;
 ✅ Added time zone support for reminders;
 ✅ Birthdays can now be anniversaries, memorials and other yearly events;
 ✅ Reschedule all overdue reminders at once, with Undo;
 ✅ Added app shortcuts for quick add, focus timer and pinned routines;
 ✅ Undo for deleting items from preview and edit screens;
 ✅ Added single Todo reminder widget;
 ✅ Added PRO Trial (Free only), extend it by 24 hours with a rewarded ad;
 🐞 Bug fixes and improvements.
